{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/depthfirstsearchevent"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"What a depth-first search reports, in order, with the classification of CLRS §22.3.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/backEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/crossEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/discover(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/forwardEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/treeEdge(_:)"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A vertex is discovered, then every edge out of it is reported once per copy, then it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finished. An edge to an undiscovered vertex is a tree edge, and the search continues from that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex before the next edge. An edge to a vertex discovered but not yet finished is a back"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge; a self-loop is one. An edge to a finished vertex is a forward edge when that vertex was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discovered later than the edge’s source (a descendant; a repeated tree edge is one), and a cross"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge otherwise."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent"}],"title":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","externalID":"s:9Traversal21DepthFirstSearchEventO","role":"symbol"},"references":{"doc://Traversal/s8CopyableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","title":"Swift.Copyable"},"doc://Traversal/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://Traversal/documentation/Traversal/DepthFirstSearchEvent/forwardEdge(